# Native libraries shipped with the standalone (macOS dylibs, Windows MSVC
# runtime DLLs, Linux .so) must never be EOL- or encoding-normalized, regardless
# of a contributor's core.autocrlf / core.eol settings. Without this, a clone with
# autocrlf=true relies solely on git's content heuristic to leave them untouched.
*.dll   binary
*.dylib binary
*.so    binary
